{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d597e559-266d-8c08-a58c-c0537235e2d8",
  "created_at": "2026-02-03T11:48:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marco Lombardozzi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:42:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:43:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. The Christmas tree."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:43:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the Christmas tree. Are you asking about getting it picked up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:43:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Is that, do they take it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:43:15-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me make sure I've got it right. You've got a Christmas tree still at your place and you want to know if the city will collect it. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:43:27-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:43:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Can I get the address where it's sitting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:43:32-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "387 Admiral Kalbfus Road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:43:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "387 Admiral Kalbfus Road, that's up in the North End. Is that a house or a business?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:43:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Business. And I live upstairs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:43:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so a business with an apartment above. Got it. And where is the tree right now? Out by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:43:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "By the door. Inside the gate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:43:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "By the door, inside the gate. Alright. So here's the thing, Mr., I didn't catch your name, sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:44:05-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lombardozzi. Marco."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:44:07-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mr. Lombardozzi, thank you. Now, the holiday tree pickup is usually a short window in January, and it's separate from the regular trash. Do you know if you put it out in January at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:44:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. I thought it was the, with the recycling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:44:25-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. A lot of people think that. The trees normally don't go in with the regular recycling bin. They go out loose, no bag, and only on the days the city announces for them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:44:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No bag?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:44:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No bag. If it's in a plastic bag or has the tinsel and lights on, they'll usually leave it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:44:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It has lights."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:44:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then those would have to come off first. Are the lights still on it right now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:44:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Some. My nephew did it. He didn't finish."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:45:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Your nephew helped with the tree. Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:45:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "He's staying the week. Eats constantly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:45:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Ha, well, that'll keep you busy at the store, I'd guess. Alright, let me look at the schedule for you. Hold on one moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:45:19-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:45:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks for holding. So I'm looking at it, and the tree collection window for this year has already passed. It was in January."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:45:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's too late."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:45:33-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For the special tree pickup, yes. But you asked when the next pickup is. Do you mean the next regular trash day for your street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:45:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. When's the next one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:45:46-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me check your route. 387 Admiral Kalbfus Road. It's Tuesday today, so, hm. Your trash is picked up on Thursdays, and recycling is the same day but alternating weeks. So the next one would be this Thursday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:46:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This Thursday. Trash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:46:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Trash for sure this Thursday. For recycling, I'd want to double check which week you're on. But the tree isn't recycling anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:46:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the tree goes in the trash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:46:16-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not exactly in the bin, since it's too big. What you could do is cut it down into pieces, maybe three or four feet long, and bundle them with twine. Then they may take it as bulk yard waste. I'd call that the likely answer, but let me check with the crew side if you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:46:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cut it. With a saw."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:46:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A hand saw would do it. Or your nephew, since he's got energy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:46:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "He eats. Doesn't saw."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:46:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay. Well, the other option is the drop-off at the transfer station, if you can get it there. Do you have a truck?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:46:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A van. For the business."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:47:02-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A van would work for a tree. Just take the lights off first. I don't have the hours in front of me, so I'd have you call back to confirm those."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:47:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "What number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:47:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This same line, Public Works. Ask for the solid waste desk and they'll tell you the hours."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:47:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So Thursday, the trash. Cut it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:47:27-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read it back so we're on the same page. Thursday is your trash day. The tree's too late for the special pickup. Lights off, cut it in short pieces, tie it with twine, and put it out Thursday, and it may be taken. Or bring it to the transfer station in the van."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:47:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Twine. Not a bag."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:47:50-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, no bag. Twine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:47:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And the recycling. I don't know which week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:47:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the part I'd want to confirm. Do you remember if you put the blue bin out last Thursday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:48:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think. Maybe not."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:48:06-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's okay. If you're not sure, the easiest thing is to look and see whether your neighbors put theirs out Thursday morning. Most of the street is on the same week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:48:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:48:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And if there's still a doubt, call me back and I'll go through the calendar with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:48:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lorraine, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:48:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:48:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thursday. Twine. I still don't get the tree part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:48:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair, it's confusing. Short version: it's past the special pickup, so cut it up and tie it, and try Thursday. If they leave it, you'd take it to the transfer station."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:48:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:48:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Lombardozzi. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:48:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Bye."
    }
  ],
